        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.579,
            0.846,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "However, when we talk about the net of a solid, we consider only the shape formed by unfolding the solid, and not the other supporting flaps that we may use to actually make the solid."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.635,
            0.845,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Apart from using a net, there are other ways to make a cube from paper."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.683,
            0.763,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There are multiple possible nets one can use to build a cube."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.712,
            0.295,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
